            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yakoba ati: “Nja kuzikiriza ebintu byonabyona ebiri ku nsi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu, n'ensolo, n'enhonhi, n'ebiba mu nhandha. Nja kuzikiriza aboonooni boonaboona, n'abantu boonaboona baaweegho ku nsi. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nja kubonereza abantu ab'omu Yerusalemu boonaboona n'abo ababa mu Buyudaaya mwonamwona. Era nja kuzikiriza abasinza omusambwa Baali boonaboona abakaasigairegho, n'amaina aga bakabona abamugheereza goonagoona geerabirirwe irala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nja kuzikiriza abo abaaniina ghaigulu ku ndhu okusinza ebintu eby'oku igulu, n'abo boonaboona abansinza nze Musengwa Katonda, kabiri ni bamala balayira omusambwa Moleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era nja kuzikiriza abo boonaboona abatakaidha ye ndi waire okunsaba okubabeera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musiriikirire aghali Musengwa Katonda, kuba olunaku lwe luli kumpi kutuuka. Musengwa Katonda ategeike okughaayo abantu be basalibwe ng'oti musengo, era amaze n'okweta abageni abaja okukola omukolo ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAB.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hab 2:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.2.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 2:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Nja kubonereza abakungu ba kyabazinga, n'ab'endhu ye, n'abo boonaboona abaagema empisa edh'abamaghanga agandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo, nja kubonereza abo boonaboona abasinza mu nsinza ey'abamaghanga agandi, era ni baidhuza endhu ya musengwa waibwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "endhu ya musengwa waibwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "oba “eisabo ly'omusambwa gwaibwe”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " omunhago gwe bafuna mu kwiba ni mu kutemula.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
