          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Ku lunaku olwo, ghaja kubaagho okulira gha Mulyango ogwetebwa ogw'Ebyenhandha ogw'ekibuga Yerusalemu, era ghabeegho okuwowoola mu Kiketezo Ekiyaaka eky'ekibuga ekyo, era ghabeegho okugwa okw'amaani mu nsozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwowoole inho imwe ababa mu kiketezo eky'eifo eky'ekibuga, kuba abasuubuzi baimwe boonaboona bawoiregho okufa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu kiseera ekyo nja kutoola entaala nje nga ndhagaaza mu Yerusalemu mwonamwona. Nja kubonereza abantu boonaboona abali obulungi abazira kibeeraliikiriza, abakoba mule bati, ‘Musengwa Katonda ghazira ky'aidha kukola, ka kibe ekirungi oba ekibi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eby'obukombe byaibwe bija kunhagibwa, n'endhu dhaibwe dhimenhebwegho. Waire bali kuzimba endhu, aye tibaja kudhisulamu. Waire bali kusimba amasamba ag'emizabbibu, aye tibaja kunhwa ku mwenge gwa mizabbibu guva mu masamba ago.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunaku lwa Musengwa Katonda olukologho luli kumpi era luli kwangughaku inho. Olunaku olwo okuluwuliraku lwa bulumi, era luliza n'abasaadha abalwani ab'amaani! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olunaku olwo luja kuba lwa busungu, lwa bizibu, lwa kuzikirira era lwa bulumi. Luja kuba lunaku lwa kuzikirira na kusaanagho. Luja kuba lunaku lwa kivumbi era lwa kazigizigi, olwidhwire ebire n'enzikiiza agemye bedimudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo amagwala agalaalika olutalo gaja kuvuga, okuleekaana okw'abalwani kuwulirwe nga balumbye ebibuga ebyezungulwirwa ebimante ebigumu, n'ebituuti byaku ebireeyiriri ebirengererwaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
